          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno apodho piny i wang’ Yehova ceng’ pier ang’wen ku diewor pier ang’wen m’apodho ie piny, kum Yehova wacu nia ebinyothowu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E arwo ni Yehova, man awacu kumae, E Rwoth Yehova, kud inyoth dhanu peri man aba peri m’iwaru ni kum dwong’ peri, m’iwodho kud i Misiri ku cing’ ma tek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Poi kum jutic peri Ibrahim, Isak, man Yakobo; kud inen udhuku mi dhanu maeni, kadi camuco migi, kadi dubo migi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng’om m’iwodhowa kud i ie maru wacu kumae, Kum Yehova copo terogi i ng’om m’eng’olo igi ngo, man kum edagugi, ewodhogi kara eneggi i langa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento gi dhanu peri man aba peri, m’iwodho ku tegoni ma dit man ku boti m’arieya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
